# Pairs with InFlightBaseSurvives. Publication ignores the check's verdict:
# an increment that found its base's row gone registers anyway.
MODULE: InFlightBaseSurvivesPublishesAbandoned
TARGET: InFlightBaseSurvives
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an increment whose check failed is published
PERTURBS: Register

--- FIND
    /\ cap[c].ph = "ok"
    /\ cat' = cat \cup {cap[c].id}
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: a failed check publishes too.
    /\ cap[c].ph \in {"ok", "abandon"}
    /\ cat' = cat \cup {cap[c].id}
--- END